            <h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-5xl leading-[1.02] tracking-tight">
              Keep your library.<br />Keep calibre, too.
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-6 max-w-md leading-relaxed text-sand-11">
              Dalibre reads and writes calibre's own format. Open your library
              in either app, any day; nothing to import, nothing to export.
