          <ul class="divide-y divide-sand-6 border-y border-sand-6 text-[15px]">
            <li class="flex gap-4 py-4"><span class="font-mono text-sand-9">→</span>Uses calibre's <code class="font-mono text-sm">metadata.db</code> schema, triggers and all</li>
            <li class="flex gap-4 py-4"><span class="font-mono text-sand-9">→</span>Folders and files named the way calibre names them</li>
            <li class="flex gap-4 py-4"><span class="font-mono text-sand-9">→</span>Edits write <code class="font-mono text-sm">metadata.opf</code>, so calibre picks them up</li>
            <li class="flex gap-4 py-4"><span class="font-mono text-sand-9">→</span>Removed books go to the system trash, not into the void</li>
          </ul>
